  <History Date="02-10-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM Model ID" />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed move in dark range.  Standardised across product range." />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed Standard and Basic channel mapping (swapped col preset dim and control)." />
  <History Date="31-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised Col Preset function names across product range.  Added vdim to Extended mode cells and removed 'ExtendedCellVDim' mode." />
  <History Date="28-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Ayrton MagicBlade-R" />
  <History Date="30-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
